---
import BlogEntryShell from "./BlogEntryShell.astro";

const today = new Date();
---

<BlogEntryShell
  title="Trail entry not found"
  description="The requested trail entry wandered off the Mother Road and ignored all posted signs."
  pubDate={today}
  location="Santa Monica Pier"
  weather="Forecast: low visibility, scattered wrong turns, and a 100% chance of retracing your steps."
  mapPoints={[{ label: "Santa Monica Pier", latitude: 34.0094, longitude: -118.4973 }]}
>
  <p>
    This trail entry does not exist. It appears to have taken an unscheduled detour, ignored the map,
    and become emotionally unavailable.
  </p>
  <p>
    The good news is that <strong>Santa Monica Pier</strong> is still on the map, which is more than I
    can say for this URL.
  </p>
  <p>
    <a href="/blog">Return to trail log index</a>
  </p>
</BlogEntryShell>
